Subject: [PATCH 3/3] C-64: ingest survives a refused line and reports its
 network calls; ladder guard uses the reading's date

The order ingest records a line the cohort writer refuses (an amount that reconciles to
nothing) under not_recorded instead of failing the whole run, and every run reports how many
network calls its reader made. The value-ladder discount guard now measures against the
reading's own date. The retention list says that the creative north star reads expedition
and grid-tournament rows by month inside the horizon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GpoRAgr4kBWxi1752HufQh
